{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>減肥｜減肚腩食物｜想減肚腩除了運動、避免久坐，還可以食住瘦？台灣營養師分享8樣蔬菜，媲美「腸道清道夫」，有助腸胃蠕動，防止便秘，有助減少身體吸收油脂，穩定血糖，擊退肚腩。</p><figure><img alt=\"肚腩的成因有不少，有些是因便秘而起。（Pixabay）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220401/586613535413374976396401.jpeg/cpny5cqGMZ7sMLV8-PwaV48v2eP4Knxxxyrwr8cq8K8\"/><figcaption>肚腩的成因有不少，有些是因便秘而起。（Pixabay）</figcaption></figure><p>減肚腩食物｜肚腩成因　可能多吃脹氣食物</p><p>肚腩的成因有不少，可能是吃得太多運動太少，讓脂肪累積；也可能是吃多了易脹氣食物所致；也有些因便秘而起。針對因腸道蠕動不良，使大便有困難而引致的肚腩問題，在日常飲食中要留意膳食纖維攝取。</p><p>減肚腩食物｜腸道清道夫8大蔬菜　預防便秘腹脹</p><p>據香港衛生署健康資訊，建議青少年及成年人每天應該攝取約不少於25克的膳食纖維。不過，食用纖維攝取不足仍然是普遍問題。台灣營養師朱瑞君在個人平台分享8樣蔬菜，堪稱「腸道清道夫」，不僅幫助腸胃蠕動，也助減少身體吸收油脂，穩定血糖。</p><p>按圖睇腸道清道夫8大蔬菜︰</p><figure><img alt=\"腸道清道夫8大蔬菜\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220401/586616881587163136724981.jpeg/wKunJiLByDpxlBkfyIf6FsIc3mOo16CevVJVK71SVSs\"/><figcaption>腸道清道夫8大蔬菜</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"腸道清道夫8大蔬菜（Pixabay）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220401/586616883957075968178905.jpeg/9WtlRFdIZgXIM0rObFZzi-28c83Cv4UCtMJZQLTCWUA\"/><figcaption>腸道清道夫8大蔬菜（Pixabay）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"腸道清道夫8大蔬菜（VCG）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220401/586616886717059072812479.jpeg/JVAjYg4aoMYMW4G4jvWWLW8L0ThC52JY8epT1fHqU9U\"/><figcaption>腸道清道夫8大蔬菜（VCG）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"腸道清道夫8大蔬菜（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220401/586616888923394048786215.jpeg/6jWFRK6XXyQBXC7CQZFn56vgisqgZK_lPLPA6DyzwOg\"/><figcaption>腸道清道夫8大蔬菜（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"腸道清道夫8大蔬菜（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220401/586616891163283456983105.jpeg/VXRIoQsgEjTVk_o3eXhLsUtD_d5nufzzJO1fuCTtX7g\"/><figcaption>腸道清道夫8大蔬菜（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"腸道清道夫8大蔬菜（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220401/586616893600305152210745.jpeg/zLIsChVgb2KCFZN15Sz-6JQtKDi2NQD9WjG5-loxufo\"/><figcaption>腸道清道夫8大蔬菜（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"腸道清道夫8大蔬菜（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220401/586616895919886336120583.jpeg/E-C_9YtxZg00Jg2y1NTd0C_7A2DUgEcKIBnW3yAZ1t8\"/><figcaption>腸道清道夫8大蔬菜（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"腸道清道夫8大蔬菜（VCG）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220401/586616898101055488452869.jpeg/FeCVaburIlz9Ew4-JFvlTTi7qEYPtYp3VXYZnVV2GZ0\"/><figcaption>腸道清道夫8大蔬菜（VCG）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"腸道清道夫8大蔬菜（VCG）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220401/586616900261253120357126.jpeg/C8Yye_M7ReTa14CdgYyUggCRL0RpdvNAy5TX6MuU1-g\"/><figcaption>腸道清道夫8大蔬菜（VCG）</figcaption></figure><p>腸道清道夫8大蔬菜</p><p>1. 菠菜：膳食纖維豐富，助腸胃蠕動。\n2. 海帶：含不飽和脂肪酸，助清除多餘膽固醇。\n3. 秋葵：含水溶性纖維，促進消化道健康及美顏。\n4. 枝豆：含蛋白質和纖維，可增加飽足感。\n5. 苦瓜：富含水溶性纖維，有助降血糖。\n6. 蓮藕：含蛋白質及高纖，助減油脂吸收。\n7. 冬菇：水溶性纖維豐富，可吸收多餘膽固醇。\n8. 紅蘿蔔：同時有豐富的維他命，增強人體免疫力。</p><p>資料參考︰輕鬆瘦營養師 朱瑞君</p><p>8款蔬菜可製作不同菜式，菠菜、秋葵、蓮藕更可作涼拌菜，不妨參考以下食譜：</p><p>食譜推介：涼拌菠菜爽脆鮮甜　全靠一塊壽司蓆方便快捷</p><figure><img alt=\"涼拌菠菜食譜\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200729/365246556254900225.jpeg/7tHdd1B3mthxYCDs9xbVXYWPNpcwgB76trf_p7a3_6c\"/><figcaption>涼拌菠菜食譜</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涼拌菠菜食譜\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200729/365246678707605504.jpeg/hTiRaP-ozjLRxSnfHfIoxU0kMEE43vEQRvdfX0b3X18\"/><figcaption>涼拌菠菜食譜</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涼拌菠菜食譜\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200729/365246680846700544.jpeg/e21uZGldm5ejVONv67lZsTN8Dhp3z1IyRo_bJkaP2yY\"/><figcaption>涼拌菠菜食譜</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涼拌菠菜食譜\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200729/365246684160200704.jpeg/K-0GvaqrBWwNzG9mFscD75AeXJH7lJTdHtrNTx7azU8\"/><figcaption>涼拌菠菜食譜</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涼拌菠菜食譜\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200729/365246686517399552.jpeg/jyLyr1PLQISQhOTyOf7_7-x2n-NDzpnGw703Q8O9N0M\"/><figcaption>涼拌菠菜食譜</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涼拌菠菜食譜\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200729/365246688870404096.jpeg/PPee8CK4Qgp1hTBjHXCja_Fy1l8PgyALRnjaFEZ42hQ\"/><figcaption>涼拌菠菜食譜</figcaption></figure><p>食譜推介：涼拌秋葵兩食　麻醬、酸辣汁一生一燙「綠色人參」</p><figure><img alt=\"涼拌秋葵食譜\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/1864508/org/3711d170cf50a2db37e5d6dff41a0fea.jpg/Y_pQdEFw7ZAgZyWlQNTjILoVKIblnxBVnCXPJ5wlzyc\"/><figcaption>涼拌秋葵食譜</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涼拌秋葵食譜\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/1864509/org/04affc4a842291275fda04c687884807.jpg/isflql3oJcQAaZII90MyQNlRS34u2DGI_ZjVa_2Y1Ws\"/><figcaption>涼拌秋葵食譜</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涼拌秋葵食譜\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/1864512/org/7d6bcef1e37f276323dfe95cb8f16961.jpg/085yYLhHAGyQ11MQTT_mi9vBwWux-DscwHvWRsB71kY\"/><figcaption>涼拌秋葵食譜</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涼拌秋葵食譜\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/1864511/org/ec2e85b67e20ac743c3d12d41d5e4057.jpg/kjTFSWJGcUls6sx_qnHE8-LofPNe1Roh7MFZhezBWYU\"/><figcaption>涼拌秋葵食譜</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涼拌秋葵食譜\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/1864510/org/f69589f18a32354d53932b13205c0f11.jpg/RjqvDMtVK_3JTlkGJcq7Zg_zam6tV_5H3U3hgN1N4YA\"/><figcaption>涼拌秋葵食譜</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涼拌秋葵食譜\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/1864513/org/e3b9d80f2970e5ba4548543b45b776fb.jpg/vPhPYbDVTCVaxfE9MfPD_GRSMFZquMSAGJU50RiVOdE\"/><figcaption>涼拌秋葵食譜</figcaption></figure><p>食譜推介：甜酸蓮藕片爽脆開胃　醃兩個鐘食得！</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200429/332259872487903232.jpeg/VOjWLF2l3GSWEX8jkIBuOyeqC8hUi2G_8bYDRvG2A0Y\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200429/332260267662643200.jpeg/QBhxoPOsS0Lr9wwc_Ghou3qS6nkcYTCN7TpZ5e06WeU\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200429/332260269571051520.jpeg/IkLhkBYcLH7RrQ8cK-FXJmd4XOYmOPeuMKPptTCj6bU\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200429/332260271919861760.jpeg/r8ocYgEvhx6jG5A6zRfAlMlORF2QW_Pq8klBuPJJQbg\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200429/332260273912156160.jpeg/lZ17nlNrrJxlZ0eWi5bLDVKUNViLQfbhEwnMCxMJzAs\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200429/332260276239994880.jpeg/8NTLwtPAP-i85pwGuw33p6xtxVinxh4FBG9XuQRvV7k\"/><p>9個擺脫小腹肚腩的方法</p><p>據運動星球文章表示，沒有一種方法可消除小腹周圍的脂肪，因為不能針對身體的局部而減脂，想減掉腹部脂肪，就須同時減掉身上其他部位的脂肪。局部運動訓練，例如仰臥起坐、捲腹等，可以增強腹部肌肉，使腹部線條更結實好看，但它實際上並非完全消除了腹部的脂肪，努力減重是減小腹的唯一方法。</p><p>下圖有9個擺脫小腹肚腩的方法︰</p><figure><img alt=\"9個擺脫肚腩方法（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200514/337580618479177728.jpeg/GYWrcF4QWD3bKc6UTWaEE8gEYO-mfN0vcnLLEXJyyxE\"/><figcaption>9個擺脫肚腩方法（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"9個擺脫肚腩方法（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200514/337580620324671488.jpeg/6YlJwKgr2rAU8CHtlrEtZzf-Dt8_4sOC4UX61OFF-tQ\"/><figcaption>9個擺脫肚腩方法（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"9個擺脫肚腩方法（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200514/337580622333743104.jpeg/VsEHH6pU9MwDxuxoxx95302FeXnFcKCP7JKP6-ySj-s\"/><figcaption>9個擺脫肚腩方法（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"9個擺脫肚腩方法（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200514/337580624472838144.jpeg/8fMMxLfSQmmdRMu64vYPL3GfBaG3G86cne9SYJ3vUmA\"/><figcaption>9個擺脫肚腩方法（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"9個擺脫肚腩方法（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200514/337580627324964864.jpeg/YDq_-9dfpEi2kABIQEAUrVPX-0iicvq_KgRhnioEYZ4\"/><figcaption>9個擺脫肚腩方法（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"9個擺脫肚腩方法（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200514/337580630181285888.jpeg/P4XArFNS8zQsqvfVc_htAr7fUt91wkKOOQrmmjkK5po\"/><figcaption>9個擺脫肚腩方法（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"9個擺脫肚腩方法（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200514/337580632358129664.jpeg/-ohGGZPBTr4t6QeGqu0X0F7xQPLvIJJVYSllw2EpZcM\"/><figcaption>9個擺脫肚腩方法（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"9個擺脫肚腩方法（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200514/337580634396561408.jpeg/kRByETsLKaiIAB_00cUGySRaJ69o7y42_67Rh_-u0Yc\"/><figcaption>9個擺脫肚腩方法（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"9個擺脫肚腩方法（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200514/337580636825063424.jpeg/-lt7yts7xFA10X23GHq4G0CT_zl9CQ55rbEMkq2xDJI\"/><figcaption>9個擺脫肚腩方法（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"9個擺脫肚腩方法（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200514/337580639035461632.jpeg/1x5jtbPbpZUy2ed3VLX1jXfJStxCgMg316lzztepc84\"/><figcaption>9個擺脫肚腩方法（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>1 減少攝取熱量</p><p>2 減醣</p><p>3 增加蛋白質</p><p>4 停止喝高熱量飲料</p><p>5 嘗試間歇性斷食</p><p>6 做高強度間歇性訓練</p><p>7 嘗試阻力訓練</p><p>8 足夠睡眠</p><p>9 持續檢視自己的壓力狀況</p><p>延伸閱讀︰生薑熱可可｜踢走肚腩3周瘦腰4吋血管變年輕？專家解謎可可6好處</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220401/586620940385783808653814.jpeg/__VcVt0rdazq78iG-xMQGR_sPqaLnDMmI1gRVyNYEVc\"/></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-28T04:19:47.364413+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1361,"images":39,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}